<title>USA: OXFORD HEALTH TO BUY FLA. HEALTH INSURER.</title>
<headline>OXFORD HEALTH TO BUY FLA. HEALTH INSURER.</headline>
<dateline>NORWALK, Conn. 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oxford Health Plans Inc said Thursday that it has agreed to purchase Riscorp Health Plans Inc, a Sarasota, Florida health insurer.</p>
<p>In a press release, Oxofrd said that Riscorp offers point of service and HMO health plans to 15,000 members in the Orlando, Tampa, Jacksonville, Miami and southwest Florida area.</p>
<p>Terms of the agreement were not disclosed.</p>
</text>
